bookofkane-extendeddescription-NCWL = A book of speeches from the organizer whose uprising helped turn Vaucelles into Chengridz. Kane still guards the League's revolutionary mandate.
bookofkane-extendeddescription-DSM = An affront to all values a righteous noble should stand for!
bookofkane-extendeddescription-SHI = An affront to all values a corporate employee should stand for! My Boss can't see me reading this!
bookofkane-extendeddescription-TFSC = An old revolutionary text. SAW crews may find more to argue with here than the other Free Companies do.
bookofkane-extendeddescription-ATH = A revolutionary text hostile to hereditary privilege. Crown observers would certainly record who carries it.
bookofkane-extendeddescription-SRM = A revolutionary affront to sacred hierarchy, and therefore useful evidence for a Hunt.
